{"id":"68a0c2277f810a1b","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-fixed-point-lemma.md","title":"Fixed Point Lemma","display":"thm-fixed-point-lemma — Fixed Point Lemma","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-fixed-point-lemma","aliases":["58-thm-fixed-point-lemma","Fixed Point Lemma","Ordinal Fixed Points"],"display":"thm-fixed-point-lemma — Fixed Point Lemma","depends_on":["[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-thm-ord-induction]]","[[58-df-normalfunction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-fixed-point-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-fixed-point-lemma</span><span>Fixed Point Lemma</span><span>Ordinal Fixed Points</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-fixed-point-lemma — Fixed Point Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"128d9b202b57929c\" href=\"?note=128d9b202b57929c\" title=\"58-thm-ord-induction\">58-thm-ord-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8f8c5722fd8d964f\" href=\"?note=8f8c5722fd8d964f\" title=\"58-df-normalfunction\">58-df-normalfunction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (class graph of a normal ordinal function) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (ordinal class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(F)\\)</span> (normal ordinal class-graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8f8c5722fd8d964f\" href=\"?note=8f8c5722fd8d964f\" title=\"58-df-normalfunction\">58-df-normalfunction</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{Normal}(F)\\to\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(\\beta\\leq\\alpha\\land\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle\\in F\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{Normal}(F)\\to\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(\\beta\\leq\\alpha\\land\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle\\in F\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed points: fundamental in ordinal analysis.</li>\n<li>Fixed points of the aleph function are not the same thing as inaccessible cardinals.</li>\n<li>Iterated derivatives: higher-order fixed points.</li>\n<li>The fixed-point class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fix}(f)\\)</span> is closed and unbounded.</li>\n<li>The derivative <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;\">\\(f&#39;\\)</span> enumerating fixed points is again normal.</li>\n<li>Epsilon numbers: fixed points of exponentiation.</li>\n<li>Used in: ordinal analysis, proof theory, large cardinals.</li>\n<li>Fixed points are expressed as diagonal pairs in the class graph; no set-function application is made to a proper-class-domain map.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-ord-induction","status":"resolved","id":"128d9b202b57929c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-ord-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-normalfunction","status":"resolved","id":"8f8c5722fd8d964f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-normalfunction]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord}$ (ordinal class, see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-normalfunction","status":"resolved","id":"8f8c5722fd8d964f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Normal}(F)$ (normal ordinal class-graph predicate, see [[58-df-normalfunction]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\mathrm{Normal}(F)\\to\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(\\beta\\leq\\alpha\\land\\langle\\alpha,\\alpha\\rangle\\in F\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fix}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f'","display":false}],"bytes":1463,"backlinks":[{"id":"f4cb3e4202cdd4ba","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-fixed-point-lemma.md|58-thm-fixed-poi